(   [Problem Statement]: Using the Theorems of Pappus-Guldinus, derive the exact expressions for: \(1\) Total surface area and volume of a circular torus, \(2\) Surface area and volume of a right circular cone.) Tj
T*
(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   1. Circular Ring Torus Derivation:) Tj
T*
(   A torus is generated by revolving a circular disk of radius 'r' about a coplanar axis) Tj
T*
(   located at distance 'R' from the center of the circle \(R > r\).) Tj
T*
(   \(a\) Surface Area via First Theorem:) Tj
T*
(   Perimeter of generating circular curve: L = 2 * pi * r.) Tj
T*
(   Centroid of the circular perimeter is at its center: y_bar = R.) Tj
T*
(   Distance traversed by centroid in one revolution: 2 * pi * R.) Tj
T*
(   Surface Area = 2 * pi * y_bar * L = \(2 * pi * R\) * \(2 * pi * r\) = 4 * pi^2 * R * r.) Tj
T*
(   \(b\) Volume via Second Theorem:) Tj
T*
(   Cross-sectional area of generating circle: A = pi * r^2.) Tj
T*
(   Centroid of area is at center: y_bar = R.) Tj
T*
(   Volume = 2 * pi * y_bar * A = \(2 * pi * R\) * \(pi * r^2\) = 2 * pi^2 * R * r^2.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   2. Right Circular Cone Derivation:) Tj
T*
(   A right circular cone of base radius R and height h is generated by revolving a right-angled) Tj
T*
(   triangle of base R and height h about its vertical leg h \(y-axis\).) Tj
T*
(   \(a\) Volume via Second Theorem:) Tj
T*
(   Area of generating triangle: A = \(1/2\) * R * h.) Tj
T*
(   Centroid of triangle from the vertical axis of revolution: x_bar = R / 3.) Tj
T*
(   Distance traversed by centroid: 2 * pi * x_bar = 2 * pi * \(R / 3\).) Tj
T*
(   Volume = 2 * pi * x_bar * A = [ 2 * pi * \(R / 3\) ] * [ \(1/2\) * R * h ] = \(1/3\) * pi * R^2 * h.) Tj
T*
(   \(Verified!\)) Tj
T*
(   \(b\) Lateral Surface Area via First Theorem:) Tj
T*
(   The lateral surface is generated by revolving the inclined hypotenuse of length L = sqrt\(R^2 +) Tj
T*
(   h^2\) \(slant height s\).) Tj
T*
(   Centroid of straight hypotenuse line is at its midpoint: x_bar = R / 2.) Tj
T*
(   Lateral Area = 2 * pi * x_bar * L = \(2 * pi * R / 2\) * s = pi * R * s.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(--------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
ET
