45 780 Td
(   [Problem Statement]: Explain the concept of Principal Moments of Inertia and Principal Axes. Derive the mathematical formulas for the principal angle theta_p and principal moments I_max and I_min.) Tj
T*
(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   1. Coordinate Rotation and Transformation of Inertia:) Tj
T*
(   Let x and y be coordinate axes with known properties I_xx, I_yy, and I_xy.) Tj
T*
(   Consider rotated axes \(u, v\) inclined at counterclockwise angle theta to \(x, y\).) Tj
T*
(   The transformation equations for coordinates are: u = x*cos\(theta\) + y*sin\(theta\), v =) Tj
T*
(   -x*sin\(theta\) + y*cos\(theta\).) Tj
T*
(   Evaluating I_uu = Integral\(v^2 dA\) and I_uv = Integral\(u*v dA\) yields:) Tj
T*
(   I_uu = [ \(I_xx + I_yy\)/2 ] + [ \(I_xx - I_yy\)/2 ] * cos\(2*theta\) - I_xy * sin\(2*theta\)) Tj
T*
(   I_uv = [ \(I_xx - I_yy\)/2 ] * sin\(2*theta\) + I_xy * cos\(2*theta\)) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   2. Derivation of Principal Angle theta_p:) Tj
T*
(   Principal axes are defined as axes about which the product of inertia vanishes: I_uv = 0.) Tj
T*
(   Setting I_uv = 0:) Tj
T*
(   [ \(I_xx - I_yy\)/2 ] * sin\(2*theta_p\) + I_xy * cos\(2*theta_p\) = 0) Tj
T*
(   sin\(2*theta_p\) / cos\(2*theta_p\) = - 2 * I_xy / \(I_xx - I_yy\)) Tj
T*
(   tan\(2*theta_p\) = - 2 * I_xy / \(I_xx - I_yy\)) Tj
T*
(   This equation yields two orthogonal angles \(separated by 90 degrees\), defining the principal) Tj
T*
(   axes.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   3. Expressions for Principal Moments of Inertia \(I_max, I_min\):) Tj
T*
(   Substituting the trigonometric values of cos\(2*theta_p\) and sin\(2*theta_p\) into I_uu:) Tj
T*
(   I_max,min = \(I_xx + I_yy\) / 2 +/- sqrt\( [ \(I_xx - I_yy\) / 2 ]^2 + I_xy^2 \)) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   4. Invariant Properties of Inertia:) Tj
T*
(   \(a\) First Invariant: I_uu + I_vv = I_xx + I_yy = Polar Moment of Inertia J \(Constant\).) Tj
T*
(   \(b\) Second Invariant: I_uu * I_vv - I_uv^2 = I_xx * I_yy - I_xy^2.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(--------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
ET
BT
